  3→/**
  4→ * Tool approval card shown when Claude requests permission to run a tool.
  5→ *
  6→ * Displays the tool name with formatted input parameters, Allow / Deny buttons,
  7→ * and a resolved state with colored badge. Rendered in place of a regular
